%% nest visual architecture reference
%% companion to doc/arc/arc.yaml (the machine-readable and human-readable
%% architecture reference). the pair is the source of truth; there is no
%% separate human-prose architecture doc.
%%
%% design note:
%%   this is a sequenceDiagram, not a flowchart with subgraphs. structured
%%   diagram types lay out deterministically and render cleanly on github;
%%   subgraph flowcharts with cross-cluster edges do not. the file inventory
%%   in arc.yaml is the authoritative module breakdown.
%%
%%   it traces the two flows that define nest: build (python writes the file)
%%   and query (rust serves from the file). the .nest file is the only
%%   artifact that crosses the language boundary.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as builder.py
    participant F as nest-format
    participant N as .nest file
    participant R as nest-runtime
    participant E as embed_query.py
    participant Q as nest cli / api
    participant P as embed_query_potion.py
    participant A as ask / retrieve
    participant I as image corpus tooling

    note over B,N: build · offline · reproducible
    B->>B: chunk + embed + model_hash
    B->>F: nest.build(chunks, model_hash, mrl_dim?, with_graph?)
    F->>F: optional matryoshka truncate + renorm, then quant
    F->>F: per-section try-smaller wire encoding (text: zstd / txt_streams / dict / fsst / dedup; content_hash-stable)
    F->>F: optional graph_adjacency 0x0C csr (NEXT_CHUNK + top-m semantic; excluded from content_hash)
    F->>N: deterministic emit + four hashes

    note over I,N: image corpus build · offline · media inside the .nest
    I->>I: discover images / render pdf pages (sorted, ordinal = frame no)
    I->>I: letterbox onto one canvas
    I->>I: probe_gop sonda (gop_policy=auto decides intra vs inter)
    I->>I: optional similarity_order + sharding, then encode av1/avif via pipe
    I->>I: verify frame count == item count
    I->>I: vision embed the DECODED frames (dermlip / clip)
    I->>F: nest.build(chunks, blob_refs, chunk_blob_spans, spaces=[image space], model_hash)
    F->>F: optional blob_refs 0x14 + span overlay 0x16 + space_table 0x15 + band slab 0x20+ (all excluded from content_hash)
    F->>N: deterministic emit + four hashes (media travels inside the file)

    note over R,Q: query · offline · mmap
    Q->>E: search-text spawns embedder
    E-->>Q: query vector + model_hash
    Q->>R: search(vector) / search_space(vector, space)
    R->>N: mmap open + validate hashes
    R->>R: model_hash vs manifest (per space, in isolation)
    R->>R: hnsw / bm25 / graph-bfs candidates
    R->>R: mandatory exact cosine rerank
    R-->>Q: hits + nest://content_hash/chunk_id

    note over A,N: flagship · agent-native · offline by construction
    A->>P: ask / retrieve embed query OFFLINE (potion table, no socket)
    P-->>A: query vector + model_hash
    A->>R: route by manifest capability, search (score IS the exact rerank)
    R-->>A: hits + SearchExplain (rerank_source: real cosine vs stored precision)
    A->>N: decode tier-1 stored canonical text per chunk_id
    A-->>Q: cited answer (ask) / json-jsonl answer-pack (retrieve) + nest:// citation
